// Look-dev scene (SPEC.md, "Look-dev scene"): a 2x4 brick, a 7-hole beam, a 24-tooth gear,
// a 56 mm wheel and the Rover on the grid floor. All lengths are millimetres, Z up, floor at z = 0.
// Shapes are placeholders until the real parts arrive in milestone M3.
(
    version: 1,
    camera: (
        focus_mm: (0.0, 10.0, 12.0),
        yaw_deg: -52.0,
        pitch_deg: 26.0,
        distance_mm: 520.0,
    ),
    items: [
        (
            name: "brick_2x4",
            pos_mm: (-120.0, 40.0, 0.0),
            yaw_deg: 18.0,
            shapes: [
                (shape: Box(size_mm: (31.8, 15.8, 9.6), bevel_mm: 0.15), offset_mm: (0.0, 0.0, 4.8), color: "red", material: Abs),
